	(text "RAIL DISCIPLINE: every bias references +3V3 or GND, never 5 V (GPIO26/27 are not fault-tolerant). R_PE to +5V_XCVR is the one deliberate exception."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.64 31.75 0)
		(effects
